  "source": "An employee submits a travel request to the department manager. The department manager checks whether the requested dates are available. If the dates are available, the department manager approves the request. If the dates are not available, the employee revises the dates and resubmits the request to the department manager for the same date check. After approval, HR records the approved request.",
